  "extractionNotes": "Closing note: maternity benefit granted. Employment 2022-07-02..2025-08-30 ending on the birth date (a fixed-term contract extended to the birth is inferred), so the benefit is paid by ZUS after the title ended. Pregnancy: employer sick pay 2025-01-17..2025-02-18, then sickness benefit paid by the employer 2025-02-19..2025-08-29 (the payer reports more than 20 insured; checkbox read from the summary page, inferred). ZAM: maternity 2025-08-30..2026-01-16 (20 weeks) and parental 2026-01-17..2026-08-28 (32 weeks) with the 81.5% declaration ticked; application 2025-09-02. ZUS asked the employer for the leave certificate and for an explanation of a difference between the Z-3 and the monthly RCA report for 2024-09; the employer corrected the Z-3 twice (missing leave period; 128.00 overtime added to 2024-09). Salary table 2024-01..2024-12 from the final corrected Z-3: column 6 as fixedPay, columns 7 + 8 as variablePay, contributionBase inferred as their sum; sick months 2024-06..08 are in the table at contractual values; from 2024-09 the employer reports 14 working days a month. The maternity Z-3 also ticks the 'benefit equal to maternity benefit' box for the parental period, a form error. asOf = date of the last ZUS letter."
